                <tr style="padding:0px">
                  <td style="padding:2.5%;width:63%;vertical-align:middle">
                    <p style="text-align:center"> <name>Daniel Kiv</name> </p>
                    <p>I am a fourth-year PhD student in Computer Science at the
                      University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign (UIUC) working
                      with Prof. <a href="https://ggis.illinois.edu/directory/profile/shaowen">Shaowen
                        Wang</a>. I am interested in machine learning and
                      geography. I'm currently studying population statistics,
                      with a focus on crime mapping. I also work in remote
                      sensing and environmental science. I am grateful to be
                      awarded the <a href="https://nij.ojp.gov/funding/fellowships/graduate-research-fellowship-program-past-and-present-fellows">National
                        Institute of Justice Graduate Research Fellowship</a>.</p>
                    <p style="text-align:center"> <a href="mailto:dkiv2@illinois.edu">email</a>&nbsp;
                      /&nbsp; <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=uI_sQzgAAAAJ&amp;hl=en">google
                        scholar </a>/ <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7624-8163">orcid</a>
                    </p>
